=== ADVERSARIAL CONCLUSION ===
PART1 c3 E/Var closed forms == Z-engine, n<=10: MATCH
PART2 brute enumeration c3,c5,c7,H == Z-engine & polys, n<=7: MATCH
PART3 independent per-subset linearity == polys, n<=8: MATCH (c7 at n=8 is OUT of brute range, confirms poly not just a fit artifact)
PART4 leading (k-1)!/2^k baseline confirmed
n=5 identity 1+2E[c3]+2E[c5]=E[H]=79/8: confirmed exact (low-n coincidence as claimed)
H values 2,4,79/8,29,3175/32 confirmed via independent Redei Hamiltonian-path count.
